        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVnGrdk8-KdZQgxMyVF8VOvQHrPahYKjrsy2oaAQCrcCO5GdQ3A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Despite a minor confusion caused by the previous management of this garage, Mr. Philippe, the new owner, made tremendous efforts to resolve the matter to my complete satisfaction. He accomplished this brilliantly.\nReceiving this level of customer service is truly exceptional and, above all, very much appreciated.\nAlso, congratulations to Mr. Arend, the garage manager.\nI will remain a loyal customer, and I confidently recommend this garage.",
        "time": 1742310158,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lynda Livernoche",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114461594529409524039/reviews",
