        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLe1h1x7WrGqKUF7z4oRKzrw1RSt0PPfbO4MwAUyo1sXkO6oQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I am a long-time customer, however, I was disappointed with the usually outstanding service. The person at the counter blamed his poor time management on me for informing me that my vehicle had been ready for over half an hour. He even insisted a few times that I should have notified him since I was in the waiting room and could see that my vehicle was ready.",
